    </div>
    <div id="viewer-body">
      <div id="viewer-empty">
        Select a file from the tree. Left column: line numbers on a per-line
        <em>git blame</em> age heatmap (hot = last touched recently; hover for SHA).
        <br/><br/>
        Prefer: <code>git-heat --serve</code> (in-memory page; needed for blame + file load).
        Use <code>--html</code> only if you want a file on disk.
